sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Front end
    participant E as Engine
    participant W as Workers and watcher
    F->>E: new engine, subscribe, set_waker
    F->>E: open_workspace with the roots
    E->>W: index on a worker
    W-->>E: result over a channel, waker called
    F->>E: pump
    E-->>F: event WorkspaceIndexed
    F->>E: invoke with a command id and CommandArgs
    E->>E: command runs, document edited, undo recorded
    E-->>F: event DocumentChanged
    E->>W: parse, diagnose, render after a settle
    F->>E: next_due, then sleep until it or a wake
    W-->>E: result
    F->>E: pump
    E-->>F: PreviewReady, DiagnosticsUpdated
